window.products.push({"id":884027,"name":"econoLED Rabbit Puller Red Wine Bottle Cork Opener Tool Corkscrew Collar Pourer Gift Set US Seller with high quality","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ho5G1pRyL._AC_.jpg","description":"Description: Product Feature: Comes packaged in a beautiful presentation gift box, this item truly is a must have for any true wine lover! HOW TO USE: The first step in using the opener is to bring the lever firmly down to closed position.  Firmly grasp the grip handles with one hand and swing lever to full open position. Put the opener over the bottle until it stops in the exact position. Grip the bottle neck firmly with the grip handles. The black screw comes out of the metal axis. Slowly bring the lever up and return to closed position. The screw has been driven fully into the cork and is ready to pull the cork.  Keep a firm grip on the bottle neck with the handles and slowly lift the lever back and over the bottle to the open position.  Remove the bottle by loosening your grip on the handles.  Take the cork out of the corkscrew. Package included:  1x Rabbit-style wine opener 1x Foil cutter 1x Replacement screw 1x Stand ☛EconoLed products have been well tested, examined and packaged before sending off, but we cannot 100% guarantee the items remain undamaged when delivered to you. Any problem please feel free to contact us first so that we can supply the best service for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ho5G1pRyL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"econoLED","source_asin":"B01FA3DDJQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-884027","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01FA3DDJQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01FA3DDJQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
