window.products.push({"id":884045,"name":"Mylar Mall 100 Pieces Resealable Smell Proof Bags - Heat Sealable Pouches for Long Term Food Storage, Packaging Products - Aluminum Foil and Food Grad","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713u06tURDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for storage that preserves the taste and smell of your food? It can be frustrating to store food only to find out later that it’s not in the same condition anymore. Odor and moisture from the outside have seeped in, affecting both its smell and taste. This is especially problematic when you are storing food with the intention of selling them. You’ll be losing money with a lot of damaged goods. The Mylar Mall Resealable Smell Proof Bags keep your goodies fresh and delicious! Our mylar bags have isolating barrier properties that shield your goods from the effects of moisture, air, and light penetration. Use it to store coffee beans, beef jerky, spices, chips, and other products that tend to lose their taste quality and original aroma when exposed to moisture and light. Our heat-sealable mylar bags offer a tamper-evident seal that makes it ideal for long-term storage. It also makes your packaging look professional. It’s perfect for your food business! Your customers will love the zip lock closure, allowing them to reseal the bag whenever they need to. Made with aluminum foil and premium plastic, our mylar bags are extremely durable. The clear plastic is safe and non-toxic. You can rest assured no chemicals will leach to your food. Feel free to use our bags for other storage needs. Our bags can help ensure you don’t lose small items like beads, jewelry, and hair accessories. Here are more reasons to love our mylar bags: ✅ Can be used for giving out samples, free treats, and party favors ✅ See-through plastic keeps content visible ✅ Bulk pack of 100 bags Store food and items with care. Add the Mylar Mall Resealable Mylar Bags to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713u06tURDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mylar Mall","source_asin":"B087ZF2XRX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-884045","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087ZF2XRX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087ZF2XRX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
