window.products.push({"id":884105,"name":"WingCanto 16X32 Inches Clear Office Desk Pad Mat Blotter Vinyl Table Cover Wood Furniture Screen Protection Plastic Tablecloths Coffee Table Protetcor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71t8-oV9j9L._AC_SL1015_.jpg","description":"☑️【UPGRADED VERSION TABLE PROTECTOR】WingCanto Upgraded Clear Tabletop Protector is made of premium Eco- friendly PVC vinyl, waterproof and oilproof, no plastic smell with round corner design. Suitable for families with kids, elderly or pregnant women! Our tablecloth cover is heavy enough to stay in place and would not move around. The material is soft and durable, fits the desktop perfectly. And the table mat is heat resistant, maximum to 176°F/80°C, suitable for kitchen and dining room table. ☑️【PRACTICAL PVC TABLE COVER】Our plastic pvc table top protector is transparent and waterproof, protect your wooden, glass, marble table, desk, tablecloth and furniture tops against scratches, scuffs, stains, spillage etc. The clear plastic tablecloth cover is easy to clean with damp cloth or paper towel when get stained with oil, ink, coffee, etc. Suitable for your family daily use and provides a fast and cost-effective way to protect your furniture and show the original beauty of your desktop. ☑️【CUT TO FIT】WingCanto PVC Vinyl Tablecloth Cover is available in various sizes and shapes, included Rectangle, Square and Round, so you can choose according to your needs. The dimensions we trim are usually 1-2cm bigger than the advertised dimension to avoid possible shrinkage and deviation, this is not an error in dimension. If cut works required, just mark the exact measurement with a pencil, then use a sharp scissor with a steel ruler to cut it. Then you can customize your own tablecloth. ☑️【MULTI-SCENE USE TABLE COVER】WingCanto clear vinyl table protector is designed for protecting your wood glass marble stainless steel table top, perfect as console conference table cover, dining room table cover, kitchen table protector, end table runner, office desk chair mat. ATTENTION: We DO NOT recommend to PLACE the clear pad ON a BRAND NEW WOODEN TOP, you can place a fabric tablecloth under the table pad when your wooden top is new or just painted. ☑️【QUALITY ASSURANCE & TIPS】100% Satisfaction Guarantee. CONTACT US FIRST if you are not satisfied with our table protector for any reason, REFUND OR REPLACE AVAILABLE. As the new clear table pads are rolled packed, so the table mats will be a little wrinkled and warped edge. The solution is : A. Heating it with a hair dryer to make it flat; B. Lay it in the sun for half an hour; C. Lay out in reverse-roll direction and put something heavy on top of it; D. Use your iron on the curled places.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71t8-oV9j9L._AC_SL1015_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WingCanto","source_asin":"B09L4MFDMR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-884105","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09L4MFDMR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09L4MFDMR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
