window.products.push({"id":884178,"name":"Coffee Scale with Timer, 0.1g/3kg Espresso Scale with LCD Display for Pour over and Drip Coffee, USB Rechargeable Digital Scale Measures in Grams, Oun","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rtfpXPuwL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Led Hidden Screen Coffee Scale】This coffee scale adopts high-definition led display, simple function keys and weighing platform integrated design make these coffee scales more convenient to use. Built-in High-precision sensor, responds quickly and accurately, provide you accurate measurements from 0.1g up to 3kg. Not easy to deform, high temperature resistant, up to 135 ° 【LED Digital Display】This smart digital coffee scale is designed with a large wide-screen LED digital display function, it shows the weight and timer more clearly, easy to read, convenient and intuitive, making the coffee making process more accurate and convenient. 【Countdown & Automatic Timing Function】This kitchen scales with a countdown timer design and automatic timing function to ensure the convenience of brewing coffee, so that you brew your coffee in perfect ratio and precision. Automatically reset to zero when not in use, and automatically shut down after 60 seconds, saving energy and electricity. 【Accurate Adjustable Weighing Scale】The food Scale built-in high-precision sensor, which can manage data scientifically, with an accuracy of 0.1g. The coffee scale is available 3 unit scales, You can switch between three units(grams, ounces, milliliters)with just one button, meets your different weighing needs. Perfect for the volume of liquid measuring, home cooking, baking, and food portioning. 【All-in-one & Rechargeable Design】Built-in 250 mAh rechargeable battery and type C charge cable, this electronic cooking scale can be used continuously for 5 hours after fully charged, standby time is up to 3 months, green and environmentally friendly. It is ideal gift for kitchen & office.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rtfpXPuwL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Globalstore","source_asin":"B0B11VXBM7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-884178","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B11VXBM7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B11VXBM7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
