window.products.push({"id":884184,"name":"Matte Solid Red Glass Christmas Tree Topper 11 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gCA5k-ryL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Decorate your holiday tree with BestPysanky unique mouth blown hand made Christmas tree topper! 11 Inches Tall Glass German Glass Italian Paint Mouth Blown Glittered Accents Made in Ukraine Gift Boxed It is meticulously crafted by hand using traditional techniques that originated in the 1800's. The Renaissance-era carving, molding, glass blowing, silver lining, painting and finishing processes require unparalleled skill and several weeks to complete. The molten glass is mouth-blown into finely carved molds to shape the topper. It is then painted and glittered in a series of labor-intensive steps to achieve the beautiful final products. Exquisite workmanship and details are the hallmark of all BestPysanky ornaments. We aim to bring warmth, color, spirit and sparkle into your home with our unique decor, as you admire and celebrate the holidays with your loved ones. It's more than just an ornament- it's a work of art!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gCA5k-ryL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BestPysanky","source_asin":"B07ZV5CTLH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-884184","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZV5CTLH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZV5CTLH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":884185,"name":"Empire Art Direct Ballroom Dancers Mixed Media Iron Hand Painted Dimensional Wall Art, 48\" x 32\" x 2.4\", Ready to Hang","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":190.6,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ey4KFSFkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About EADEmpire Art Direct has a long rich history of manufacturing wall art and home furnishings since 1948.At EAD, we are proud to be creating perfect decorative products on the market.Our decorations are over 1, 000 designs, EAD has a variety of wall decorations for all moments in your life.Feature:• Item Name: Empire Art Direct Ballroom Dancers Mixed Media Iron Hand Painted Dimensional Wall Art, 48\" x 32\" x 2.4\", Ready to Hang• Model Name: Ballroom Dancers• Color: Multi Color• Style: Industrial• Material: Metal• Technics: Each piece is inspected and certified by the artist as an original work of art • Packing: Packing with bubble wrap and protective corners in carton• Product Size & Weight: 48\"L x 32\"W x 2.4\"D & 16.5 lbs• Package Size & Weight: 51.8\"L x 36\"W x 2.8\"D & 20.3 lbsDecoration:Action and romance is captured in this stunning depiction of ballroom dancers strutting their stuff on the dance floor. This provocative image emanates sensual tension and the abstract style lets the viewer imagine their own storylines. Ballroom dancing is extremely popular now as it has been for over 100 years, and this mixed media sculpture expertly captures the essence of the dance. The dancers are caught in mid dip and the viewer can imagine them twirling about to the music.About returns policy and our services:If you are not satisfied with our product or order wrong item, please let us know immediately, we will offer you the best services.Check out our brand Empire Art Direct for more choices!ORDER NOW!DON'T MISS OUT, LIMITED STOCK!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ey4KFSFkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Empire Art Direct","source_asin":"B07MT64R4T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-884185","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MT64R4T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MT64R4T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":884186,"name":"Manual coffee grinder - stainless steel conical ceramic burr coffee bean grinder for espresso and french press - portable for travel and camping - Adj","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91uJ-+MvpHS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High quality materials Our coffee grinder is made with high quality food grade stainless steel. Ceramic conical burr perfectly grinds your beans instead of crushing them ensuring they have the best flavor. Bring the quality of your favorite coffee shop right into your own home. Perfect for one or two cups of coffee ensuring your ground coffee won’t dry out or go to waste.  Hand crank is smooth and easy to use so you won't hurt your hands or tire out. Top and bottom parts fit seamlessly so it won't wobble or seperate. Adjustable Our grinder has multiple settings and is adjustable for precision. You can perfectly fine tune it for any type of coffee you want to make. Fine grind for espresso and turkish, medium for pour over, moka pot,  aeropress, and coarse grind for french press, cold brew, and percolator. Quiet, compact and easy to use Simply fill the grinder with coffee beans, adjust the knob to your preference and turn the hand crank clockwise to grind. No batteries, cords, or dangerous wires getting in your way. Storage for  the handle and cleaning brush included so you know your handle will always be with the grinder and clean up will be a breeze. Handheld grinder is very quiet so you won't wake up your family in the early morning. It's small and portable, making it ideal for camping, backpacking, travel trailers, or simply using in your home and office. Quality guarantee We're so confident that you will love our coffee grinder we offer a lifetime manufacturer guarantee. Simply contact our customer service department if anything doesn't live up to your expectations. Specifications Color: SilverMaterial: Stainless steel, ceramic burrBottom Diameter: 1.8inchHeight: 6.7inchStyle: Manual grinderPackage Includes: 1 x Manual coffee grinder, 1 x removable hand crank 1x handle storage ring, 1x cleaning brush.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91uJ-+MvpHS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bstreet","source_asin":"B08TKJWMK9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-884186","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TKJWMK9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TKJWMK9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
