window.products.push({"id":884425,"name":"Messar Anti Slip Safety Bathtub Stickers, 12PCS Adhesive Non-Slip Shower Strips Treads Add Strong Traction to Tubs, Showers, Pools, Boats, Stairs, Sli","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515YmVfAJ+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"These sdhesive decals bathtub stickers strips are esay to use to any slippery suface to advoid the accident happen. These stickers allow water to flow freely further reducing the chances of soapy water accumulating. It is perfect to protect your family or guest by this simple way. They will stick firmly on the surface and not easy to peer off if you apply them in the right way. They clear tape will can fit any color surface without affect the appearance. If you want to take off these tape, they will not damage the surface of the floor and the item and will not leave any residue. Why not have a try?   Apply To Any Smooth Surface. These non-slip bathtub stickers are effective to stick to any smooth surface, such as a bathtub, bathroom floor or stairs, swimming pool, etc   How To Use?  1. Clean surface carefully, using everyday cleanser. Dry completely. 2.Wipe surface with rubbing alcohol to remove any soap/cleanser residue. Dry completely. 3.Determine desired pattern. 4.Remove backing material one tread at a time. Press each tread firmly onto surface, working from center outward. 5.Make sure all outer edges firmly attach to surface. 6. Do not touch adhesive or reposition treads during installation. 7.Allow newly installed treads to stand for 12 hours before use.  How To Remove?  1.For easy removal - Heat up the Shower Treads using a blow-dryer, This will loosen the glue. 2.Peel the edge of the treads slowly and remove the treads. 3.Reapply heat as needed. 4.Clean any remaining adhesion with any adhesive remover such as GooGone. 5.Clean the surface with any household cleaner to prevent slipping.  Specification: Material: Synthetic resin Color: transparent Individual tread size: 2 x 20cm/ 0.787x 7.87in Quantity: 12 pieces","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515YmVfAJ+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Messar","source_asin":"B08C9YKL46","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-884425","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C9YKL46","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C9YKL46","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
