window.products.push({"id":884582,"name":"Four-Tier Over the Door Towel Rack - Chrome","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41dDSvKT4aL._AC_.jpg","description":"Maximize the available space in any bathroom by hanging towels and washcloths on the Chrome Four-Tier Over the Door Towel Rack. This over the door organizer features four staggered towel bars a pair of storage hooks for hanging additional bath linens and over the door brackets that fit on 1 3/8\" or 1 1/2\" thick doors. Regent Over the Door Towel Organizer Features Durable metal construction with a polished chrome finish. Four towel bars are staggered to allow for easier drying and handling of towels. Includes over the door brackets that fit securely on 1 1/2\" thick doors and can also be pinched slightly to fit 1 3/8\" thick doors. Also includes foam rubber pads to place between the towel rack and the door to provide stability and protect surfaces. A pair of lower storage hooks provide additional space for hanging bath linens shower accessories or clothing. Euro inspired design features squared tubing for added visual appeal. Over the door towel organizer keeps towels convenient","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41dDSvKT4aL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Better Sleep Inc.","source_asin":"B002EITVQ0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-884582","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002EITVQ0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002EITVQ0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":884583,"name":"OnTarget Gaming Gaming Chair with Footrest High Back Gaming Chair with Footrest Ontarget GC100 Video Game Chair PC Racing Style Gamer Chair","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hC49AAbuS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ontarget Gaming GC100 Gaming  chair made to withstand the rigours of the most serious gamers, who spend a long time sitting in their chairs and require supreme comfort and style to help them get to the next level. All Day Ergonomics Call it what you want, a Racing Chair, office chair, video game chair, pc chair but this chair was designed to maximize comfort and style, no matter how much time you spend in it. Lumbar Support Sufficient lumbar support is key when it comes to reducing backaches. The lumbar support pillow keeps you fresher, longer, no matter your tasks. Head Support Headrest provides extra support while sitting upright to ensure you are always comfortable. It can be adjusted to your liking and its plush, cushiony feeling will leave you relaxed. Gamer Built Upholstery Gamer Chair made with carefully selected PU Leather, upholstered specifically for gamers to keep them cool, calm and comfortable so they can keep their mind focused on what’s most important. Padded Seat Extra attention is brought to the cushioning system, a high rebound density foam cushion provides the all day comfort and longevity. Reclining Backrest The tilt feature allows for 180 degree reclining so you can rest, lounge or even nap. Height Adjustable Fully Adjustable Gaming Chair allows you to easily raise and lower the height of the chair so you can fit it under desks or raise it for better view. Adjustable Armrest The armrests go up and down to accommodate different positions that require more comfort. Gaming Chair with Footrest A great way to rest, just recline the backrest and extend the footrest to enjoy maximum relaxation! Rocking Lock/Unlock rocking feature, allows you to lock in an ergonomic position and then quickly switch to a soothing rocking motion of up to 20 degrees.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hC49AAbuS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OnTarget Gaming","source_asin":"B08S65NL6F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-884583","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08S65NL6F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08S65NL6F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":884584,"name":"Rome Italy Canvas Artwork by Anderson Design Group, 11 by 14-Inch, Gold Ornate Frame","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91x8n8bZvtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang piece in a gold ornate frame features an illustration of Rome, Italy. Anderson Design Group, Inc. founder Joel Anderson graduated from Ringling School of Art & Design in 1986. He was recruited straight from college to work as a staff illustrator and designer at Carden & Cherry Advertising in Nashville, TN. While at C&C, Joel won an Emmy Award for his work on a CBS show, Hey Vern, it's Ernest. Joel worked at C&C for 7 years, learning the art & science of advertising (and how to talk like Ernest.) In 1993, Joel and his friend David Thomas founded Anderson Thomas Design, Inc. The firm focused on CD package design at first and quickly grew into a diverse print & web design company with a client list that included Universal Studios, DreamWorks Pictures, Golden Books, Thomas Nelson and more. In 2007, the partners decided to pursue different interests, so Joel reorganized the design firm as Anderson Design Group, Inc., narrowing the studio's focus to specialize in illustrative design, branding and product development. An 11x14 Gicleee print under acrylic in a gold ornate frame. Gicleee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating museum quality fine art reproductions. The piece is printed on high quality, archival paper that is textured, making the piece really stand out. A clear acrylic facing is added to protect the print. The piece is fully assembled by professional framers and comes ready to hang.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91x8n8bZvtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00KRCJOW6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-884584","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KRCJOW6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KRCJOW6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
