window.products.push({"id":884731,"name":"Sophia-Art Exclusive Boho Bohemian Mandala Duvet Cover with Pillowcases, Mandala Quilt, Boho Duvet Cover, doona Cover","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91QhFZAHPqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This gorgeous piece of art can be used as Duvet Cover. Add an ethnic feel to your room with this cotton handmade Duvet Cover. Go for a dramatic makeover of your wall and this tapestry would become a conversational piece of art. A must have in any season for all ethnic savvy ones. This is a rare beauty not to be missed, a genuine collector's item & the result of masterly workmanship. This Duvet Cover are completely screen printed in traditional Indian method and takes around a week to complete. 100% Cotton - This Duvet Cover are printed, not quilted or woven. They are hippie Indian Duvet Cover. Thin as sheet. Good, tight power loom construction. Each Duvet Cover has its unique imperfections. In some cases what printers would call registration errors are intentionally included on the screen print to simulate hand woodblock prints.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91QhFZAHPqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sophia-Art","source_asin":"B072LYQB6D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-884731","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072LYQB6D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072LYQB6D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
