window.products.push({"id":884803,"name":"DreamInn Creative Macaron Pillow Decorative Throw Pillow Shaped Plush Pillow Cushion (Purple+Light Purple)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fxI6V6HvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Macaron Throw Pillow Cushion Shape: Round Size: 37cm/14.5 inch in Diameter, 15cm/5.9 inch in Hight Cover Material: Plush Material Insert Material: PP Cotton Package included: 1 PC Pillow Cushion Usage: Office, Home, Bedroom, Drawing Room, Living Room, Family Room, Play Room, Study Room, Dinning Roo","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fxI6V6HvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DreamInn","source_asin":"B0773SVH74","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-884803","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0773SVH74","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0773SVH74","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":884804,"name":"Dirt Devil 088400 Vision Turbo Vacuum","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/316RHD2Q6DL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Through the transparent window, watch as the Dirt Devil Vision with Turbo as the Vacuum sucks up massive amounts of dirt, dust and pet hair. The heavy-duty 12-amp motor is protected by Motorguard technology, so the machine will keep running for years. There are no bags to buy or empty as the machine uses a large washable container to catch the debris. Features 3 rows of rotating brushes, turbo tool, deluxe stretch hose for furniture and curtains, swivel casters, scuff-guard bumper, 32\" power cord and a bright headlight for dark, dusty corners. Imported. 11Hx15Wx26L\". Amazon.com Convenient and full of features, the Dirt Devil Vision upright vacuum is a heavy-duty cleaning machine for the whole house. Suitable for bare floors, above-floor tasks, and multiple heights of carpet, the 12-amp machine features a dial-adjusted floor nozzle with a triple-row agitator brush roll for cleaning and grooming carpet fibers. Its dirt collection is bagless, using a generous, transparent dust cup instead of cumbersome bags. When dirt and debris pile up inside, the cup simply pops off the vacuum to be emptied--this task made simpler by its lid and built-in handle. An internal pleated HEPA filter traps 100 percent of ragweed and pollen as well as the majority of dust, irritants, and pet dander. The filter taps clean for regular maintenance and typically lasts about a year before it needs replacing. Though the Vision's bagless construction is somewhat bulky for fitting under furniture, its onboard accessory set counteracts that shortcoming. Designed for instant use, the onboard hose is substantial and stretchy, providing powerful suction for dusting shelves, snagging cobwebs, and cleaning in tight spots. The standard onboard attachments include a dusting brush, a crevice tool, and an extra wand. The more high-tech attachment is the motorized Turbo Tool, which has its own brush roll, making it perfect for upholstery and carpeted stairs. Dirt Devil equips the Vision with other welcome extras, like quick-release power cord hooks, a carrying handle, and a bright headlight. The vacuum carries an especially generous warranty--three years on the parts and six years on the motor. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/316RHD2Q6DL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dirt Devil","source_asin":"B00022NGF2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-884804","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00022NGF2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00022NGF2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":884805,"name":"Eiffel Tower Wine Charm Sets, 14","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51a71UzB+CL.jpg","description":"Show your guests that there's no place like Paris with these \"tr??s adorable\" Eiffel Tower wine charm sets Want to add the style of the City of Love and Lights to your big day Well, with these favors, your guests - and their glasses - will be charmed, Parisian-style! And, that means there'll be no need for anyone to whine that they can't find their wine when your guests take these fabulously French and fabulously Fashioncraft favors home and use them for their next gathering. Description and details: Set of four wine charms Each measures 1 1/4\" x 1/2\" (2\" x 1\" with ring) Pewter finish all-metal charms in the famous shape of Paris' Eiffel Tower Each charm has cutout details to ensure a strong resemblance to the Tower Charm is attached to a silver metal, clear-bead-accented hoop that attaches to the wine glass stem Each ring has a different color of beads - pink, yellow, clear, and blue - to cheerfully identifying whose drink it is Packaged on top of a tan staging inside a clear-topped box with cr??me colored base, decorated with Parisian landmarks - perfect for display of the charms Box is wrapped and tied with a white organza bow and an attached \"For You\" tag To add personalized tags,click here","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51a71UzB+CL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B00JE5D6AS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-884805","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JE5D6AS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JE5D6AS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
