window.products.push({"id":884829,"name":"mibasies Cat Insulated Lunch Box for Girls Kids Rainbow Bag for School","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mr0bz1JXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤ Premium Material: This cat lunch box for girls made of soft and safe Glitter polyester. Strong polyester fabric connected by dense stitching that makes this lunch bag durable. The Vibrant Rainbow Glitter make it the perfect girls lunch box for going out as it will become more shiny and maximum its charm in the sun. ❤ Insulated and Easy-clean: This girls lunch box internal is easy to clean and waterproof, keeps your food and drink insulated nicely for hours, improve the freshness and taste, give your child a healthy life. ❤ Muti-functional and Roomy: 9.5”(L)x4”(W)x8.5”(H). Our girls lunch bag is compatible with most of America’s favorite children’s lunchbox. The elastic side pocket fits a water bottle nicely. The convenient zipper back pocket offers extra space for condiments and napkin. The lunch box internal zipper mesh pocket is great for holding knives, forks, and spoons. ❤ Practical Design for Kids: Double Zipper with Long Puller makes the lunch box easy to open even for toddler. Features Handle on top with a Snap Buckle to carry by hand or clip the girls lunch box to a backpack for saving room,it also come an adjustable and detachable shoulder strap for making hand free, that’s so convenient for going out. We also design the small Name Tag in our lunch box for writing your kids name on, so she could identify her lunch bag easily. ❤ Perfect Gift for Little Girls: Shinny little cat ears and eyelashes on this rainbow lunch box. It's a hit and trendy element among the little girls. This girls lunch box is easy for matching with different kinds of backpack and bring so much fun to your little princess’ lunchtime.Perfect gift for your daughter, granddaughter, niece, etc. Your little one will obsessed with this fashion and practical school partner.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mr0bz1JXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"mibasies","source_asin":"B08KXL8FF2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-884829","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KXL8FF2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KXL8FF2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":884830,"name":"6ft Eco-Friendly Oncor Premium Aspen Christmas Tree","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VhfOL7uHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Size: 6ft This 6ft Oncor Premium Aspen Christmas tree arrives with 3-section trunks and a tree top with a metal tree stand. All Oncor Recycled Christmas trees are made of 100% Recycled PVC plastic instead of new plastic, thereby Reducing the use of fossil fuels in the production process. All of our trees are made from non-toxic PVC with tin-based stabilizers instead of lead. The Purpose of Oncor Recycled Trees is to make Christmas eco-friendly by supplying Recycled Christmas trees to eco-friendly consumers for 30 to 50 or more joyful Christmases. We use the best quality raw materials and tree parts to give all Oncor trees a minimum product life of 30 to 50 or more years in order to make 30 to 50 or more joyful Christmases eco-friendly. Oncor green boxes are made from strong Recycled material cardboard with resin coating on the surface to resist dampness. Consumers can continually Reuse our boxes to store Oncor trees after Christmas. We are the only international specialist manufacturer in artificial Christmas trees to use super glue instead of white glue, on every tree branch, to prevent tree tips from falling off within 30 to 50 years. Our eco-friendly, disciplined, engaged, and happy colleagues are well-trained to pack trees into boxes and leave no wasted space in order to keep all trees in the best shape. All Oncor tree trunks are made with a unique technology of paint-coating both sides of the metal pipes and all wire branches to prevent rust for at least 30 to 50 years. Established in May 1980, Oncor is the oldest Christmas tree factory in China. Our trees have an industry-leading product life of 30 to 50 or more years. Our Just Cause is to build a better world in which people can embrace using Recycled materials more often, Reuse products with longer product lives, and continuously Reduce daily waste, thereby making our planet a better place. Let's make Christmas eco-friendly by using Recycled Christmas trees.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VhfOL7uHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oncor","source_asin":"B07ZM2WKKP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-884830","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZM2WKKP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZM2WKKP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
