window.products.push({"id":884967,"name":"Automatic Liquid Soap Dispenser, Upgraded 17oz Touchless Soap Dispenser for Kitchen Bathroom, 5 Adjustable Control Dispensing Less Liquid as Best Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mBbCisLiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🖐️PRECISE SENSING - The sensor soap dispenser automatically applies liquid soap onto your hands or dish sponge in seconds, no need to manually press the soap bottle. With this no touch soap dispenser, we can enjoy a more hygienic way to wash hands or dishes. 🧼LARGE 17oz CAPACITY - The touchless soap dispenser can hold 17ouces liquid soap, reduce the trouble of refill due to the other small capable soap dispenser, you can enjoy 1400 times no touch cleaning with single fill of liquid soap, and it is easy to refill, just simply open the lid to fill more soap, the clear dispenser shows clearly once it's time to top up, and it is suitable for all liquid soap(not compatible with foaming soap). 🚿REDUCE WASTE - Upgraded 5 adjustable control dispense right amount of soap, you can adjust your favorite amount level, press minus sign to get the least level 1, ,press plus sign to get the most level 5, the lower is perfect for hand washing, while the higher is ideal for dish sponges or shower. No drip dispenser also help you to save soap, it is more economical than traditional soap dispensers. ✅SAFE DESIGN - The hands free soap dispenser is safty designed with waterproof material, durable base and battery operated, it can be safely placed on your kitchen or bathroom sink, using the 4 AA batteries (not included) is more safe to use around water than others needed power on with wall outlet. 🎁PERFECT GIFT - The automatic hand sanitizer dispenser is perfect gifts to mom, wife, daughter, girlfriend. It is perfect for high traffic area including homes, restaurants, offices, hospitals, and schools. It has silver-white-clean sleek design, this eye catching design can well match with any kitchen or bathroom décor, the clear part can show your soap color to decor your homes color, show the photos of your happiness from your gifts to your loved people.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mBbCisLiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gadjica","source_asin":"B09MP94GGJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-884967","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MP94GGJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MP94GGJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":884968,"name":"Urban Chic Industrial Metal Cross Post Hurricane Lantern, 6 3/4 Square x 14 1/4 Inches Tall, Rustic Bronze Iron and Crystal Clear Glass, Vintage Style","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gLbQ6LwnL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Capture the spirit of urban industrial chic style with the Metal Cross Post Hurricane Lantern. Place it atop a tables, steps or set upon mantels for dramatic lighting effects. Add led or wax candles to illuminate your spaces. Crafted of bronze colored iron that is made to look like the antique original, each lantern is made with crystal clear glass panels that installed between the cross post exterior and inside framework. Ideal for display outdoors on decks and patios, but stunning inside as well. Just over 1 Ft tall, this well sized, this lantern measures as follows: 6¾ L x 6¾ W x 14¼ H inches. With beautiful sleek architectural details, each glass paneled lantern features an extended loop style handle and a circular raised air vent with punched holes. Fantastic gift items, the Urban Chic Cross Post Hurricane lantern is displayed with equal ease all year round from season to season So gorgeous, you'll want to keep it at home for yourself. Enjoy! By Whole House Worlds Welcome to the product line of Whole House Worlds. The New York based company offers high quality, stylish products for every room in the house, and beyond. From the kitchen, to the living room, to the bedroom, dining room, home office, closet and garden: Our criteria are comfort, quality, style and value.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gLbQ6LwnL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WHW Whole House Worlds","source_asin":"B004VMTEMS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-884968","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004VMTEMS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004VMTEMS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":884969,"name":"TIMEMORE Coffee Scale with Timer, Espresso Scale with Flow Measurements, Digital Coffee Scale with Auto Timing Mode for Pour Over & Espresso, 2000g/0.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":98.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OHMZDpGmL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"INTIMATE AUTO MODES: Apart from a built-in timer to monitor time, the digital scale even monitors flow rates which could help brewers refine their pouring speed and strength while brewing flavored coffee. Automatic timing modes are upgraded that automatically start when the scale senses a change in weight, especially for espresso and pour-over coffee. COMPACT FOR ESPRESSO: Measuring 3.9 inches x 4.5 inches x 0.8 inches and weighing only 0.51 pounds, it's the ideal size to take it everywhere in a bag or even your pocket. Also, the gram scale is small and slim enough to fit on a drip tray of a compact home espresso machine as well as pour over coffee. QUICK AND PRECISELY: The Black Mirror Nano and Basic Plus have the same precise measurements but perform much more responsive, and Nano has a larger weighing capacity range from 0.1 grams to 2000 grams, in 0.1 gram intervals. SLEEK YET CLEAR DESIGN: With few embellishments, the coffee weight scale boasts a clean and modern design made with high-quality acrylic, including a tilted LED display that's hidden from sight until the scale is in use. Plus physical buttons for the timer, power, tare, and flow rate function are located on both sides of the scale for easier operation. QUICKLY BE RECHARGED: This scale features a built-in lithium battery, which can last for up to 15 hours and recharge by the Type C USB port. Additionally, It comes with both an auto power-off function after 3 minutes of inactivity and a physical switch on the side to save battery life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OHMZDpGmL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TIMEMORE","source_asin":"B0B1ZKKJRX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-884969","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1ZKKJRX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1ZKKJRX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
