window.products.push({"id":884999,"name":"NEATERIZE Extra Large Storage Bins - Set of 2 XL Storage Baskets for use as Closet Storage or Shelf Organizer - Extra Large Storage Bins with Handles ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p5DMBA6sS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★ PERFECT BASKETS FOR ORGANIZING: Each storage baskets measures 17 x 13 x 13 inches making them great for holding crafting supplies, art supplies, large blankets or towels, pet supplies, memorabilia and much more. The more you use them, the more ideas you'll have for these versatile storage bins! Deep design makes them perfect for odd or tall items and each storage basket is stackable, freeing up valuable closet or shelf space where you need it most. Makes a great long term storage bin! ★ STORAGE BASKETS FOR SHELVES: NEATERIZE rings you a complete organization and storage system at a great value! For the price of one ordinary container, you'll get two extra-large sturdy storage bins with lids that are deep enough to hold nearly anything you can think of. Plus, they assemble quickly and are foldable, so you can stow each storage bin away when not in use. Each one features a label area for easy identification of its contents plus sturdy handles for greater portability. ★ MAKES A GREAT TOY BIN: Need a toy box for boys or girls? NEATERIZE storage baskets make perfect toy boxes for kids! Plus unlike traditional toy bins that your kids outgrow, these multi-purpose large storage boxes can be used for different things as your children grow. Use them for plush toys, action figures, dolls and more, as well as papers, artwork and other supplies. Many parents use these organizers and storage for sports uniforms and gear. ★ DURABLE STORAGE BOX - Stack these durable storage boxes and watch how much space you free up instantly! Great for tight spaces or unused areas like the bottom of the closet. They also make great shelf organizer baskets for the pantry, towel closet and more. Put one in the garage and you'll have an instant storage bin for motor oil, windshield cleaner and more. The possibilities are truly endless with the NEATERIZE organizers and storage system. ★ BUILT TO LAST: Unlike traditional storage bins, NEATERIZE boxes are built to last, with sturdy, durable stitching that goes together quickly and easily yet protects your items from dust build-up thanks to the included lids. Great for storing family heirlooms like quilts, dish sets and more. The more you use them, the more uses you'll discover for them, making these durable, sturdy boxes the ideal solution for all your organization and storage needs!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p5DMBA6sS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NEATERIZE","source_asin":"B098W69QW2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-884999","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098W69QW2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098W69QW2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
